OL,3,GNEWSAWomen-only housing and rough
OL,4,Asleeping pods proposed
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople sleeping rough in Worcester
OL,7,Fcould be offered short-term
OL,8,Faccommodation pods and expanded support
OL,9,Fservices under a #1.7m plan.
OL,11,FWorcester City Council said the
OL,12,Fproposals were designed to reduce
OL,13,Flong-term rough sleeping in the city
OL,14,Fand help people achieve greater
OL,15,Fstability and independence.
OL,17,FThe package includes plans for
OL,18,Fspecialist supported accommodation,
OL,19,Fwomen-only housing, additional mental
OL,20,Fhealth support and a new outreach
OL,21,Fservice to engage with people sleeping
OL,22,Fon the streets.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
